        <Highmate MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Highmate>
        <VRE_Animakin MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,Ludeon.RimWorld.Royalty,vanillaracesexpanded.phytokin">0.03</VRE_Animakin>
        <VRE_Gauranlenkin MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology,vanillaracesexpanded.phytokin">0.02</VRE_Gauranlenkin>
        <DV_Avaloi MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.avaloi">0.02</DV_Avaloi>
        <AG_Forsaken MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sarg.alphagenes">0.02</AG_Forsaken>
        <DevDesigner_XenotypeWoodElves MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,DevDesigner.Elves.Continued">0.02</DevDesigner_XenotypeWoodElves>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Pilgrim's Way</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>The faith is carried on foot. A pilgrim walks from shrine to shrine as those before walked, asks for shelter at any door and blesses the house that gives it, and keeps a hostel open for whoever walks the road behind. What is holy is not kept behind walls: it is visited, and told of on the way. Old Brannoc prayed at every people's shrines and never asked whose they were, and nor does the fellowship.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Proselytizer</li>
      <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VMemesE">VME_Nomad</li>
    </forcedMemes>
